# Amber

!!#O#Slides# ++TU!)Amber++ is a slide studio with glossy 3D shapes, spring-animated menus and a full-screen presentation mode. Its ribbon works like PowerPoint, and slides are Keydown text. Presentations are saved as `.ka` files!

[Open Amber](/amber) · [Phone version](/amber/mobile/)


::divider{wavy|Amber|orange}
## The ribbon

| Tab | What you will find |
| --- | --- |
| ++GL;)Home++ | New Slide, Font, Paragraph, Spacing, Shapes, Arrange and Rotate & Flip |
| ++GL;)Insert++ | Table, Chart, Icons, Diagram, Footer & Numbers, OpenDB Images, Shapes, Aero Chip, Text Box and Annotate (Draw) |
| ++GL;)Keydown++ | Re-format Slide, Un-format Slide, Keydown Text Box and Keydown Styles |
| ++GL;)Design++ | Themes, Format Background and Apply to All Slides |
| ++GL;)Transitions++ | Preview, Effect Options and Timing |
| ++GL;)Animations++ | Preview, Add Animation, Animation Pane and Timing |
| ++GL;)Slide Show++ | From Beginning, From Current Slide, Presenter View and Hide Slide |
| ++GL;)View++ | Normal, Slide Sorter and Notes views, Zoom and Layout |

## Building a deck

1. Press ++TU!)New Slide++ and pick a layout!
2. Type into a text box. Keydown tags work there: use **Insert > Aero Chip** or the Keydown tab for chips and styles!
3. Add shapes, tables, charts and diagrams from the Insert tab!
4. Pick a theme in ++TU!)Design++, and add transitions and animations!
5. Press ++TU!)From Beginning++ to present full screen. ++TU!)Presenter View++ is under Slide Show!

## Tips

* Shapes can be rotated, flipped and given opacity and shadows (Home > Rotate & Flip)!
* The ++TU!)Slide Sorter++ view shows every slide at once!
* **Annotate (Draw)** on the Insert tab lets you draw on a slide!
